       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-3D-SPATIAL-CLAY.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-3D-SPATIAL-PROOFS.
           05  WS-SPATIAL-PROJECTION-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-AESTHETIC-EQUILIBRIUM-OK PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-QUATERNION-ROTATION-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CURVATURE-CONTINUITY-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-3D-SPATIAL-SEAL-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-3D-SPATIAL-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-3D-SPATIAL-PROVEN    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-3D-SPATIAL-CODE    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-PROJECTION-AND-EQUILIBRIUM.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-QUATERNION-AND-CURVATURE.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-3D-SPATIAL-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-PROJECTION-AND-EQUILIBRIUM.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SPATIAL-PROJECTION-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-AESTHETIC-EQUILIBRIUM-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-QUATERNION-AND-CURVATURE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-QUATERNION-ROTATION-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CURVATURE-CONTINUITY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-3D-SPATIAL-PROOFS.
           IF WS-SPATIAL-PROJECTION-OK = 1 AND
              WS-AESTHETIC-EQUILIBRIUM-OK = 1 AND
              WS-QUATERNION-ROTATION-OK = 1 AND
              WS-CURVATURE-CONTINUITY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-3D-SPATIAL-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-3D-SPATIAL-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-3D-SPATIAL-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-3D-SPATIAL-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-3D-SPATIAL-CODE.
